{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For you shall surely kill him.</b> If he went forth from the court acquitted, return him to guilt; if he went forth from the court guilty, do not return him to acquittal (there)." "<b>Your hand shall be upon him first.</b> It is a commandment upon the hand of the witnesses to put him to death. If he did not die by their hand, let him die by the hand of others, as it is said: <b>and the hand of all the people, etc.</b> (see Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {0 "Rashi cites the same source (שם, 'there') as in the preceding comment; 'there' refers to a Tannaitic source such as Sifrei."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:55.954647220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}